  "sn22.86:1.1": "This discourse is also found at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn44.2/en/sujato'>SN 44.2</a>. ",
  "sn22.86:1.2": "",
  "sn22.86:1.3": "",
  "sn22.86:1.4": "",
  "sn22.86:1.5": "This makes it clear that in this context, “realized one” cannot be just any sentient being. See note on <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn16.12/en/sujato#1.4'>SN 16.12:1.4</a>. ",
